      "side": 1,
      "message": "PE_SNK_SELECT_CAPABILITY calls charge_manager_force_ceil, which changes the charge limit immediately (by board_set_charge_limit). So, it\u0027s ok for the limit applied in the deferred task to be overruled by PE_SNK_TRANSITION_SINK. Am I missing something?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
