        "id": 1182824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-02T06:50:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "...and, for other cases, that called through the charge_manager_refresh deferred functions, the charge ceils and charge currents will be evaluated in sequence, so I think there won\u0027t have race conditions.",
      "parentUuid": "67a2b804_62f12ec5",
      "revId": "a1e0797aeeee9230d309db5a830ec579b8fd9ed9",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
