      "writtenOn": "2023-03-02T21:26:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "pd_ceil_enforced[] is referenced only in charge_manager_refresh, where the flag is cleared necessarily if it\u0027s set. So, I don\u0027t think we need to worry about it left uncleared.",
      "parentUuid": "32b19d8a_e67fe98a",
      "revId": "a1e0797aeeee9230d309db5a830ec579b8fd9ed9",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
